# round 76 (w95): the physical graph degree as an input to the transformer that reads the solve. Stores from degree_affine_store.py cover all 6,607 genes (wild-type vector where the pFBA store has no row, instead of the all-zero row round 65 read). Arms: genomepathlogwt = wild-type rows only (control, against 0.570); genomepathlogwtdeg = degree and clustering of the physical graph as two more affine columns (against 0.570 and the convolution 0.755); pathlogwtdeg = the same store on the released split, which must hold 0.908. Six seeds each, three cells a pack.
